From 6dd78386baebcba17d1551332e787a13115fbaac Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Daiki Ueno <ueno@gnu.org>
Date: Fri, 27 Feb 2026 06:57:16 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 03/11] BACKPORT: nettle: use Nettle provided function types

